{"4002570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wait, is THAT me?", "steam_appid": 4002570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are being recorded.</strong> Each step you take, each weapon trigger you press, each melee swing and each word you say are being monitored. Be wary of your actions, as each of these <strong>recordings</strong> will be redone by exact replicas of you, soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/134db6d746769bad4b5bf0cb9542843e.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/134db6d746769bad4b5bf0cb9542843e.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies start swarming you, your task is to keep them at bay. Enemies drop experience which can level up your character, granting a random upgrade out of the many existing ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/5a8d46883854e8bcda18bd9172f2db4f.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/5a8d46883854e8bcda18bd9172f2db4f.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades will be inherited by your clones. Become too strong and you might struggle to dodge your clones. Stay too weak and the swarm of enemies might become too much to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/2f4f138b1b740a9db2f9e14b13ffdb0c.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/2f4f138b1b740a9db2f9e14b13ffdb0c.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't do it alone. The game features both coop and versus modes. Imagine the fun of watching and hearing your and your friend's clones having the argument about stealing that one chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer with proximity voice chat</strong> + clones that mimic your voice = dumb fun</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unique environments</strong> with various secrets, enemies and loot to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tens of weapons</strong> to choose from to withstand your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+</strong> <strong>Upgrades</strong> that will likely affect you and your clones in interesting ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An underlying narrative</strong> that will catch you off guard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many enemy types</strong> whose sole purpose is to put you in fun and difficult scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>And yes, that is you.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are being recorded.</strong> Each step you take, each weapon trigger you press, each melee swing and each word you say are being monitored. Be wary of your actions, as each of these <strong>recordings</strong> will be redone by exact replicas of you, soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/134db6d746769bad4b5bf0cb9542843e.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/134db6d746769bad4b5bf0cb9542843e.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies start swarming you, your task is to keep them at bay. Enemies drop experience which can level up your character, granting a random upgrade out of the many existing ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/5a8d46883854e8bcda18bd9172f2db4f.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/5a8d46883854e8bcda18bd9172f2db4f.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades will be inherited by your clones. Become too strong and you might struggle to dodge your clones. Stay too weak and the swarm of enemies might become too much to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/2f4f138b1b740a9db2f9e14b13ffdb0c.poster.avif?t=1777527698\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/extras/2f4f138b1b740a9db2f9e14b13ffdb0c.webm?t=1777527698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't do it alone. The game features both coop and versus modes. Imagine the fun of watching and hearing your and your friend's clones having the argument about stealing that one chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer with proximity voice chat</strong> + clones that mimic your voice = dumb fun</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unique environments</strong> with various secrets, enemies and loot to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tens of weapons</strong> to choose from to withstand your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+</strong> <strong>Upgrades</strong> that will likely affect you and your clones in interesting ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An underlying narrative</strong> that will catch you off guard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many enemy types</strong> whose sole purpose is to put you in fun and difficult scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>And yes, that is you.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Your past is being looped. Whatever you did or said was recorded and will be reenacted by an exact replica of you. Team up with friends, fight enemies, upgrade your characters, and avoid your past selves.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002570/7f2200e94a372a4f374e09f033810136c9f486ea/header.jpg?t=1777527698", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it